DSH Harness Mesh — DeepSeekBot integration patches
===================================================

Baseline: BotHarness/DeepSeekBot @ 810ae53 (feat(mobile): add device-local
chat backgrounds #2122), built with Node 24 + pnpm.

Apply from the DeepSeekBot repo root:

    git apply dsb-dreamx-all.patch
    pnpm build

Four local fixes for LAN deployment (all marked with "★DreamX 本地补丁"
comments in the source):

  1. crypto.randomUUID polyfill        — LAN origins are not secure contexts;
                                         the DSB client crashes on boot without it
  2. Auto Bot-mode entry               — deep-link straight into Bot mode
                                         (toggleable via window.__dsbNoAutoBot)
  3. Dual exit back to the main GUI    — both exit entries return to the DSH
                                         web UI (hardcoded URL, see note below)
  4. Click-to-open channel body panel  — openBot() loaded conversation data
                                         but never opened bh:channel-body, so
                                         clicking a bot in the roster looked dead

Note: patch 3 hardcodes the main GUI URL (http://<MAIN_GUI_HOST>:80/). Change
the two occurrences in workspace.tsx and bot-mode-sidebar.tsx to your own
main-GUI URL before building.

